_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2068/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Clipboard_Health.jpg","From nurses to lab assistants, many healthcare professionals in the United States are overworked and underpaid. Meanwhile, hospitals and healthcare facilities are facing a critical shortage in trained personnel that leaves them unable to adequately care for their patients. The COVID-19 pandemic further aggravated the strain on this fragile system, demonstrating the urgent need for technological evolution.\r\n\r\nAs a marketplace that directly connects medical professionals with facilities, Clipboard Health aims to provide more opportunity and flexibility by creating a mutually beneficial system. Nurses gain greater control over their work schedules while healthcare facilities gain on-demand access to trained personnel to fill unpredictable staffing shortages. With growth implications beyond the healthcare industry, Clipboard Health is paving a way to a better future of work.","Clipboard Health is leading the way to a better-working healthcare industry by providing both nurses and facilities with greater control and flexibility.","Clipboard Health - IVP Portfolio - Medical Technology Investors","Clipboard Health","An online marketplace matching healthcare professionals to open shifts at healthcare facilities",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"